.TH "DOVEADM-PROXY" "1" "May 2026" "e5ac02a" "Dovecot"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
\fBdoveadm-proxy\fR \- Handle Dovecot proxy connections (obsolete)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.P
\fBdoveadm\fR \[lB]\fIGLOBAL OPTIONS\fR\[rB] \[lB]\fB-f\fR \fIformatter\fR\[rB] \fBproxy\fR \fIkick\fR|\fIlist\fR \[lB]\fIOPTIONS\fR\[rB] \[lB]\fIARGUMENTS\fR\[rB]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.P
These commands are aliases to the doveadm-kick(1) and doveadm-who(1) commands.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.P
Report bugs, including \fIdoveconf -n\fR output, to the Dovecot Mailing List \fI\(ladovecot@dovecot.org\(ra\fR. Information about reporting bugs is available at: \fI\(lahttps://dovecot.org/bugreport.html\(ra\fR
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.P
doveadm(1)
